# Second, independent layer over the console. The JavaScript that hides the
# UI is convenience, not security; this is enforced by the server.
#
# To enable, create a password file OUTSIDE public_html:
#   htpasswd -c /home/<user>/abhyas-private/.htpasswd yourname
# then uncomment the four lines below and set the correct path.
#
# AuthType Basic
# AuthName "Abhyas review queue"
# AuthUserFile /home/<user>/abhyas-private/.htpasswd
# Require valid-user
Options -Indexes
